WEBVTT

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:01.434
These conversations are incredibly rich,

00:01:01.458 --> 00:01:04.976
because I think one of the things

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.059
that people have got growing consensus on

00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:10.101
is that step one, we kind of get, right?

00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:11.976
You shut things down,

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.184
physically distance
in whatever way you can,

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:18.059
different countries have gone about it
slightly differently,

00:01:18.083 --> 00:01:20.434
but basically that "flattens the curve,"

00:01:20.458 --> 00:01:22.042
ultimately,

00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:26.518
the number of cases,
the number of infections slows down.

00:01:26.542 --> 00:01:28.643
And, but then what?

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:32.018
Because you can't go
back to life as normal,